.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.SS Retrieve EK certificate from TPM manufacturer backend by supplying EK public.
.IP
.EX
tpm2_createek \-G rsa \-u ek.pub \-c key.ctx

tpm2_getekcertificate \-X \-o ECcert.bin \-u ek.pub \[rs]
https://tpm.manufacturer.com/ekcertserver/
.EE
.SS Retrieve EK certificate from Intel backend if certificate not found on NV.
.IP
.EX
tpm2_createek \-G rsa \-u ek.pub \-c key.ctx

tpm2_getekcertificate \-X \-o ECcert.bin \-u ek.pub
.EE
.SS Retrieve EK certificate from Intel backend for an offline platform.
.IP
.EX
tpm2_getekcertificate \-X \-x \-o ECcert.bin \-u ek.pub
.EE
.SS Retrieve EK certificate from TPM NV indices only, fail otherwise.
.IP
.EX
tpm2_getekcertificate \-o ECcert.bin
.EE
.SS Retrieve EK certificate from TPM NV indices for an EK public key, fail otherwise.
.IP
.EX
 tpm2_createek \-G ecc384 \-u ek_ecc384.pub \-c ek_ecc384.ctx
 tpm2_getekcertificate \-o ek_ecc384.cert \-u ek_ecc384.pub
.EE
.SS Retrieve multiple EK certificates from TPM NV indices only, fail otherwise.
.IP
.EX
tpm2_getekcertificate \-o RSA_EK_cert.bin \-o ECC_EK_cert.bin
.EE
.SH Returns
Tools can return any of the following codes:
.IP \[bu] 2
0 \- Success.
.IP \[bu] 2
1 \- General non\-specific error.
.IP \[bu] 2
2 \- Options handling error.
.IP \[bu] 2
3 \- Authentication error.
.IP \[bu] 2
4 \- TCTI related error.
.IP \[bu] 2
5 \- Non supported scheme.
Applicable to tpm2_testparams.
